{
  "id": "p18",
  "title": "The Orchard Partnership",
  "titleZh": "果园合伙账",
  "topic": "家庭果园与账本",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "My sister and I run the fruit farm as a small partnership.",
        "zh": "我和妹妹把果园当作一个小合伙企业来经营。"
      },
      {
        "en": "This year the fiscal report was late and very hard to read.",
        "zh": "今年的财政报表来晚了，而且非常难读。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A woman from the bank sent a letter that week.",
        "zh": "银行的一位女士在那周寄来一封信。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My mother hates paper, but I fill in the forms.",
        "zh": "母亲讨厌纸张，表格由我来填。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We had a thousand pounds and a long, useful list.",
        "zh": "我们有一千英镑和一张长长的有用清单。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then we decided to buy a new electric pump.",
        "zh": "然后我们决定买一台新的电动水泵。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "The old pump sat behind the barn, below the fruit store.",
        "zh": "旧水泵在谷仓后面，果库的下方。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A spare part cost more, so we called a young engineer.",
        "zh": "一个备件比整机还贵，我们就请来一位年轻工程师。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A sixth-form student heard about us and came to help.",
        "zh": "一位六年级学生听说后，跑来帮忙。"
      },
      {
        "en": "His mother works in education, and she knows our society.",
        "zh": "他母亲从事教育，也认识我们这边的协会。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He brought a model pump and a plan for new technology.",
        "zh": "他带来一台模型泵，还有一份新技术的方案。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We could not follow him over the engine, but we guessed.",
        "zh": "引擎太响，我们听不清他讲什么，只能靠猜。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Later the pump arrived in a package on a soft, wet day.",
        "zh": "后来在一个潮湿松软的日子里，水泵装在包裹里到了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The baby sat on the floor and marked the boxes.",
        "zh": "宝宝坐在地上，在箱子上做记号。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An animal put its tail through the fence and ate our corn.",
        "zh": "一只动物把尾巴伸过围栏，吃了我们的玉米。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our kind neighbour, an old captain, lent us his truck and horse.",
        "zh": "好心的邻居是位老船长，把卡车和马都借给了我们。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We pushed the heavy cart up the hill and hurt my knee.",
        "zh": "我们把沉重的车推上山坡，我的膝盖还受了伤。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A bell rang at noon, and we stopped for cake.",
        "zh": "中午铃响了，我们停下来吃蛋糕。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "My old school sent a card with a poem on it.",
        "zh": "我的母校寄来一张卡片，上面有一首诗。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The words were lovely, and it told our story.",
        "zh": "诗句很可爱，讲的正是我们的故事。"
      },
      {
        "en": "At least one good thing came from the long, wet winter month.",
        "zh": "漫长的湿冷冬月里，至少有一件好事。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We stood upon the hill and watched the wide sky turn pink.",
        "zh": "我们站在山上，看辽阔的天空变成粉色。"
      },
      {
        "en": "She built a wooden cover herself and thanked us all.",
        "zh": "她自己做了个木罩子，还感谢了我们所有人。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "By autumn we had nothing at all left in the bank.",
        "zh": "到了秋天，我们银行账户里什么都没剩。"
      },
      {
        "en": "During the summer the pears were soft, and we always ate them fresh.",
        "zh": "夏天梨子很软，我们总是趁新鲜吃掉。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We will divide the money and keep part for safety.",
        "zh": "我们要把钱分开，留一部分作安全资金。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The captain swam a kilometre in the cold river that day.",
        "zh": "那天船长在冰冷的河里游了一公里。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A small partnership can produce good food for a whole town.",
        "zh": "一个小小的合伙企业，能为一整座镇子供上好食物。"
      }
    ]
  ],
